{"FOLLOW_ME","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Follow you? where? I'm not sure I can, I'm sorry, I'm scared","O- okay, okay, I'll follow, but please, please, don't go too fast","Wait -- wait, let me grab my things, I'm coming, I'm coming!!","I want to trust you, I do, but my feet won't move","Are you sure? it's safe? you promise? PROMISE?","Follow you where?! I don't even know where you're going, I- sorry, where are you going?","Wait, you want me to just walk off behind you? I don't even know you, I'm sorry...","Oh, uh, I can't, my people are right back there, they'd lose their minds if I vanished","I want to, I do, but every time I follow somebody, somebody dies, so... no, sorry","Is it far? Because I can't run, my knee's shot and I'm not leaving without telling anyone","You're serious? Out there, in the open? Shit, I mean, sorry, shoot, I just... no, not today","Come on where? Oh God, that's such a scary thing to say to a person right now","Hold on, hold on, let me think- no, no I can't, please don't be mad","You seem nice and everything, but nice already burned me once"}},
{"FOLLOW_ME","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Lead the way, I'll keep my distance, and my eyes open","If you're going somewhere useful, I'll tag along","Not today -- friend, I've got my own route","Why should I follow you? what's in it for me?","Follow you, huh? Depends, where we headed and what's waiting there?","I don't follow strangers anymore, not since the Rosewood road, tell me the plan first","Hell, I'd tag along if I didn't have a mess of things to do right here","Lead on where? Give me something to work with besides 'come on', damn","Maybe, maybe, tell me what's on the other end of this walk and who else is there","No, not right now, my feet are killing me and I just sat down","Come on, he says... like it's the county fair, tell me what we're walking into"}},
{"FOLLOW_ME","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Lead on, I trust you, I'll be right behind you","Of course! show me the way, I'm right behind you"}},
{"FOLLOW_ME","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Follow you? No way","Go ahead, but I'm NOT coming","Follow you? Not until I trust you, which might be never","No, I stay put, you go, we'll see how it looks from here","You first, and I'll watch from a distance"}},
{"FOLLOW_ME","role=militia|st=friendly,neutral",{"Negative, I hold my post, but I wish you luck"}},
{"FOLLOW_ME","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Follow you? I follow nobody, {g:pal|lady}","Where we going? Don't just say \"follow me\" and expect it","Why should I? You haven't earned it","I'm not a dog, you don't call me, you ask me","You're cute, thinking I'd walk behind you"}},
