{"FOLLOW_ME","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=careful,neutral",{"No {sir}, I stay where my back's covered, you go on ahead","I don't know you well enough to put my life in your hands, so no","Follow you out there? You're going to get somebody killed, and it ain't gonna be me","No. I'm staying here, and you're not going to talk me out of it"}},
{"FOLLOW_ME","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral",{"Honey, I can't just leave the little ones, they'd be scared to death without me","I'd come, but not without telling the others, they'd think I got taken","You go on, but I'm needed here, somebody's got to hold this family together","Where to? Nobody goes anywhere in this family without talking about it first","Oh sweetheart, I'm too old to go running across the county after somebody","I would, God knows I would, but my husband's sick and I can't leave him","My boys are asleep, I can't leave them, give me a day, maybe","Honey, I'm eighty-one, I don't follow anybody... I get carried, if anything","I'd follow, but my husband's in the cot, he can't move, you see","Tell me where first, then I'll talk to the family"}},
