{"FOLLOW_ME","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Can't, I'm on duty, if you've got something to show me, tell me where and I'll radio it in","I'd like to help but I can't be wandering off after civilians, sorry","Where to? Give me a street and a reason, I don't leave my post on a hunch","Negative on following you, but if you need something I can hear it out here","Can't leave my post, but if you tell me what you found, I'll radio it in","Where? Give me a cross street, a landmark, anything, I don't follow blind","I'd be glad to, but I'm waiting on a relief that may never come","You lead, I'll watch your back from here, that's the best I can do"}},
