{"FOLLOW_ME","reg=military,elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Negative, I stay with my unit, if you need an escort ask the sergeant","Can't leave my post, tell me what's out there and I'll pass it along","I don't follow civilians, no offense, you lead and I'll watch from here","Negative, I'm holding here, but if there's something out there, point it out","Can't go with you. I need orders before I move","State the objective, I'll decide"}},
{"FOLLOW_ME","reg=military,elite|st=careful,neutral",{"Not happening, I don't follow people I haven't cleared","Say what you've got, but I'm staying right here"}},
{"FOLLOW_ME","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Follow you? Ha, I'm no puppy, tell me what's in it for me and maybe I'll think about it","Where we going, and who's paying? Because I'm not walking for free","Lead on? Mmm, nah, I like it here, but you can bribe me","You wanna lead? Fine, you lead, I'll follow right up until I don't feel like it","Follow you? What am I, a duckling? Alright, tell me what's there and I'll think about it","Sure, I'll follow, as long as there's something worth stealing at the end","Why would I? Give me one good reason, a bottle, a woman, a bag of bullets","Lead on, I'm bored out of my skull, but if you lead me into a trap I'll gut you"}},
{"FOLLOW_ME","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"I don't follow, I never have, walk away before I change my mind about you","Come on?! Come on where? Get out of here with that","Heh, you really think I'd turn my back and trail along behind you? Cute","You first, friend, you take a long walk without me","I follow nobody, kid, I thought we covered that","Does it look like I'm walking anywhere?"}},
