{"FOLLOW_ME","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Follow you? My ankle's swollen like a grapefruit, you'll be waiting for me till dark","Is there food where you're going? Because I'll walk a mile for a can of anything","Last person I followed got us surrounded, so, no, tell me the plan or go alone","My feet say no, my brain says maybe, my stomach says only if there's soup","Sure, if it's close, I've got a bad hip and worse patience","Not without telling my sister first, she'd have a heart attack","Shit, I want to, I do, but I promised somebody I'd be here when they got back","Where? Don't just say 'this way' like I'm a dog, say where","Honestly I'd rather stay put, it took me two days to find this spot","Only if you carry the heavy bag, I'm serious, my shoulder's done","You walk too fast, I'd lose you in a minute, and then I'm alone out there","Yeah, maybe, give me a second, I'm still catching my breath from last time"}},
